# PC Terminal (original design). Overworld idle frame 2 (screen shimmer).
# Source of truth for the formerly hand-inserted art-data entry (Wave 0):
# rows extracted verbatim from the shipped art-data.mjs. NOTE: the shipped
# rows paint two pixels with the key 'G', but the shipped palette never
# declared 'G' — the runtime rasterizer (art.mjs) falls back to #ff00ff
# for undeclared keys, so those two pixels have always rendered #ff00ff.
# 'G' is declared here with exactly that hex so the regenerated sprite is
# PIXEL-IDENTICAL to the shipped one (a future art pass may recolor it
# deliberately; Wave 0 must not).
PIX npc-pc-idle-2 16 16
